    title: 'Local SEO in Bangladesh: How Businesses Can Win High-Intent Searches',
    seoTitle: 'Local SEO in Bangladesh: Capture High-Intent Searches and Real Leads',
    metaDescription: 'Learn how local SEO helps Bangladeshi businesses capture high-intent searches, improve visibility and turn local demand into leads and sales.',
    excerpt: 'When someone searches for a service near them, they are often much closer to making a decision. That makes local SEO one of the highest-value forms of visibility.',
    category: 'SEO & Local Search',
    keywords: ['local SEO Bangladesh', 'high intent search', 'Google Business Profile', 'local business SEO', 'Bangladesh SEO agency'],
