    seoTitle: 'Durga Puja Brand Activation in Dhaka | 2026 Trends & Ideas',
    metaDescription: 'Explore the latest Durga Puja branding and brand activation trends in Dhaka, from retail campaigns to experiential marketing and mandap activations.',
    excerpt: 'Durga Puja is no longer just a cultural moment. It is now a major citywide consumer experience where brands can create meaningful participation and memorable visibility.',
    category: 'Brand Activation',
    keywords: ['Durga Puja brand activation in Dhaka', 'Puja mandap branding', 'Durga Puja marketing', 'brand activation Dhaka', 'experiential marketing Bangladesh', 'Puja sponsorship Dhaka'],
